    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>1. 开封中州国际饭店(出发)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[08:00 退房出发 · 前往万岁山武侠城 约 5km / 15min<br/><br/>标签: hotel<br/>坐标(GCJ-02): 114.31003578967517, 34.800731746796174<br/>高德导航: <a href="https://uri.amap.com/navigation?to=114.31003578967517,34.800731746796174,%E5%BC%80%E5%B0%81%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%9E%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E9%A5%AD%E5%BA%97%28%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%29&mode=car&src=durunzhe">点这里导航</a>]]></description>
