      <Point><coordinates>114.31003578967517,34.800731746796174,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>2. 万岁山武侠城</name>
      <description><![CDATA[08:30 入园 · 4A 大宋武侠实景演艺城 · 3000+ 场实景演出 · 全天可玩 · 【票价】全价票 100 元/人，三日内无限次入园（含万岁山 + 翰园碑林 + 开封城墙）· ⚠️[待核实]法定节假日期间入园政策可能不同<br/><br/>标签: attract<br/>坐标(GCJ-02): 114.35027039370944, 34.81962229796036<br/>高德导航: <a href="https://uri.amap.com/navigation?to=114.35027039370944,34.81962229796036,%E4%B8%87%E5%B2%81%E5%B1%B1%E6%AD%A6%E4%BE%A0%E5%9F%8E&mode=car&src=durunzhe">点这里导航</a>]]></description>
      <Style><IconStyle><color>ffFF6F00</color><scale>1.0</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/pushpin/ylw-pushpin.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
      <Point><coordinates>114.35027039370944,34.81962229796036,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>3. 西司门美食街 · 午餐</name>
      <description><![CDATA[12:00 · 开封西司/包公湖一带小吃街 · 黄家老店西司店即在此 · 人均约 40-60 元 · 距万岁山约 3km<br/><br/>标签: food<br/>坐标(GCJ-02): 114.33890244092746, 34.79488819432418<br/>高德导航: <a href="https://uri.amap.com/navigation?to=114.33890244092746,34.79488819432418,%E8%A5%BF%E5%8F%B8%E9%97%A8%E7%BE%8E%E9%A3%9F%E8%A1%97%20%C2%B7%20%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90&mode=car&src=durunzhe">点这里导航</a>]]></description>
      <Style><IconStyle><color>ffFFB300</color><scale>1.0</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/pushpin/ylw-pushpin.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
      <Point><coordinates>114.33890244092746,34.79488819432418,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
