      <Style><IconStyle><color>ff1976D2</color><scale>1.0</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/pushpin/ylw-pushpin.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
      <Point><coordinates>113.81265307044899,34.29683111301082,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>5. 西平县城(返程终点)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[18:00 抵达 · 往返全程约 410km · 国庆 10-01 至 10-07 高速免费<br/><br/>标签: end<br/>坐标(GCJ-02): 113.92321036803023, 33.388747370313375<br/>高德导航: <a href="https://uri.amap.com/navigation?to=113.92321036803023,33.388747370313375,%E8%A5%BF%E5%B9%B3%E5%8E%BF%E5%9F%8E%28%E8%BF%94%E7%A8%8B%E7%BB%88%E7%82%B9%29&mode=car&src=durunzhe">点这里导航</a>]]></description>
